    answer: 2,
    explanation: 'The zone apex techfolio.com must be an A record pointing at the load balancer IP, because a CNAME is not allowed at the apex. www and home can then be CNAMEs aliasing techfolio.com. A and AAAA records hold IP addresses, not hostnames, and NS records delegate subdomains to other name servers, so those alternatives do not work.',
