    topic: 'GKE',
    difficulty: 'easy',
    verbatim: true,
    prompt: 'A company called SnapTask, a platform for managing team projects, has developed an application consisting of several microservices. Each microservice is packaged in its own Docker container image. The company wants to deploy this entire application on Google Kubernetes Engine (GKE), ensuring that each microservice can be scaled independently. What should they do?',
